  "description": "YEZBIP crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C148 H134 K4 O24 Yb4,C4 H8 O1. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.652-3.711 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.43-105.21°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula K4(THF)9(BINOLate)6Yb4(μ3-OH)4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
